>
> As I said, it's a work in progress that needs opinions. So, here's the
> first question:
> I symbolized logic using the 'E=mc^2' equation and a short sequence of
> prime numbers. But that doesn't seem to work. Like symbolizing language by
> the shape of some talking people, how do you symbolize logic in
> a culturally neutral way? And how do you symbolize the offspring; the
> Lojban language itself?
